        {"q": "What is padding in CNNs?", "a": "Adding extra filters to the network", "b": "Adding zeros (or values) around the input border to control the output spatial dimensions", "c": "A regularization technique", "d": "A normalization step", "ans": "b", "exp": "Padding prevents the spatial dimensions from shrinking too quickly and allows filters to be applied at border positions."},
