        {"q": "What is the softmax function used for in CNN classification?", "a": "An activation function used in hidden layers", "b": "A function applied to the final layer that converts raw scores to probabilities summing to 1, for multi-class classification", "c": "A pooling technique", "d": "A weight initialization method", "ans": "b", "exp": "Softmax exponentiates each score and normalizes by the sum, producing a probability distribution over classes."},
